{"id":"53a60793a214598a","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-algebraic-cycle.md","title":"Algebraic Cycle","display":"df-algebraic-cycle — Algebraic Cycle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-algebraic-cycle","aliases":["58-df-algebraic-cycle","Algebraic Cycle"],"display":"df-algebraic-cycle — Algebraic Cycle","depends_on":["[[58-df-variety]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-algebraic-cycle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-algebraic-cycle</span><span>Algebraic Cycle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-algebraic-cycle — Algebraic Cycle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"621e8d7c1c15f553\" href=\"?note=621e8d7c1c15f553\" title=\"58-df-variety\">58-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_0,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0,X\\in V\">\\(k_0,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0,X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\">\\(\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\)</span> (exact affine-variety signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"621e8d7c1c15f553\" href=\"?note=621e8d7c1c15f553\" title=\"58-df-variety\">58-df-variety</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in V\">\\(c\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\mathcal P(X),\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\mathcal P(X),\\omega)\\)</span> (an explicit codimension map, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\omega\">\\(r\\in\\omega\\)</span> (codimension grade)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IrrSubvar}_S(W,X,k_0,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{IrrSubvar}_S(W,X,k_0,n)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)\">\\(\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)\">\\(Z^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}irreducible\\text{-}subvariety}\\vdash\\operatorname{IrrSubvar}_S(W,X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\land W\\subseteq X\\land\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(W;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}irreducible\\text{-}subvariety}\\vdash\\operatorname{IrrSubvar}_S(W,X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\land W\\subseteq X\\land\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(W;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}grade}\\vdash\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)\\coloneqq\\{W\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\operatorname{IrrSubvar}_S(W,X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\land\\langle W,r\\rangle\\in c\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}grade}\\vdash\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)\\coloneqq\\{W\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\operatorname{IrrSubvar}_S(W,X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\land\\langle W,r\\rangle\\in c\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}cycle}\\vdash Z^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)\\coloneqq\\left\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)}:\\left|\\left\\{W\\in\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X):\\langle W,0\\rangle\\notin z\\right\\}\\right|\\in\\omega\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}cycle}\\vdash Z^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)\\coloneqq\\left\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)}:\\left|\\left\\{W\\in\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X):\\langle W,0\\rangle\\notin z\\right\\}\\right|\\in\\omega\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A cycle is represented by its finite-support integer coefficient function on the set of irreducible codimension-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> subvarieties; all field operations required by the source variety predicate are explicit.</li>\n<li>The codimension map is an explicit parameter because this book currently has no compatible intrinsic dimension/codimension atom; hiding it in an unexplained operator would make the definition ill-typed.</li>\n<li>Rational equivalence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X \\times \\mathbb{P}^1\">\\(X \\times \\mathbb{P}^1\\)</span> trace; standard in motivic cohomology</li>\n<li>Bloch-Srinivas: vanishing of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"CH^n\">\\(CH^n\\)</span> for ample twist implies torsion in cohomology</li>\n<li>Bloch conjecture: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"CH^n\">\\(CH^n\\)</span> of surface of general type has dimension constraints</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fulton, Intersection Theory</li>\n<li>Bloch, Algebraic Cycles andz Localize</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"621e8d7c1c15f553","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"621e8d7c1c15f553","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)$ (exact affine-variety signature, see [[58-df-variety]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\mathcal P(X),\\omega)$ (an explicit codimension map, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k_0,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\mathcal P(X),\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IrrSubvar}_S(W,X,k_0,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"Z^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}irreducible\\text{-}subvariety}\\vdash\\operatorname{IrrSubvar}_S(W,X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\land W\\subseteq X\\land\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(W;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}grade}\\vdash\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)\\coloneqq\\{W\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\operatorname{IrrSubvar}_S(W,X;k_0,n,+_0,\\cdot_0,0_0,1_0)\\land\\langle W,r\\rangle\\in c\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}cycle}\\vdash Z^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)\\coloneqq\\left\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z^{\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)}:\\left|\\left\\{W\\in\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X):\\langle W,0\\rangle\\notin z\\right\\}\\right|\\in\\omega\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"X \\times \\mathbb{P}^1","display":false},{"tex":"CH^n","display":false},{"tex":"CH^n","display":false}],"bytes":2280,"backlinks":[{"id":"9554b584e6760909","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal S^r_{k_0,n,c}(X),Z^r_{k_0,n,c}(X)$ (graded subvarieties and cycle group, see [[../batch20/58-df-algebraic-cycle.md]])"},{"id":"3311bfe05245f437","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-algebraic-cycle.md|58-df-algebraic-cycle]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["621e8d7c1c15f553","36d7463d215be751"]}